message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RetroSave"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency 1986 cartridge ROM disassembly workbench and a
  deterministic dungeon crawler with sprite editing and speedrun replay
  verification, built in pure JavaScript. Runs entirely in the browser.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/retrosave"
url: "https://draarivpatel-ui.github.io/retrosave/"
keywords:
  - dungeon-crawler
  - retro-gaming
  - chip-8
  - deterministic
  - replay-verification
  - sprite-editor
  - javascript
  - zero-dependency
